  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region $\\{x \\in R: x \\geq 0, y \\geq 0, y \\geq x-2$ and $y \\leq \\sqrt{x}\\}$, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{13}{3}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{10}{3}$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{5}{3}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{8}{3}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The intersection point of $y=x-2$ and $y=\\sqrt{x}$ is $(4,2)$.\nThe required area\n$$\n=\\int_0^4 \\sqrt{x} d x-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times 2=\\frac{16}{3}-2=\\frac{10}{3}\n$$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0133_a81ec98b4be7.png\"><br>"
  }
}